&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Transmission Plant&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
