&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;HPGT enters into transactions with Third Coast Infrastructure, LLC and its affiliates (&amp;#8220;TCI") which are recorded to intercompany receivables and payables accounts. Affiliates are all entities under TCI and transactions include operating expenses, corporate expenses, revenue and other capital contributions and distributions. Affiliate Transactions, Net in the table above represents the net changes in the intercompany receivable and payable accounts during the year.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;For financial reporting purposes, certain salary and overhead costs incurred by TCI are allocated to the Company.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Such costs are reflected within the Operating Expenses and Maintenance Expenses in the statement of income and as contributions from TCI within Proprietary Capital in the comparative balance sheet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Expenses allocated to the Company from TCI totaled $2,046,730 and $1,785,329 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
