&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;HPGT has not submitted any requests to the FERC requesting to abandon or retire the underlying assets. As such, no expenditures are expected within the next twelve months.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '%0.'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'decimal'; -aw-list-number-values: '8'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 9.66pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;8.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="width: 9.66pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Rate Proceedings&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;HPGT is collecting revenues pursuant to its Rate Filing in Docket No. RP12-945-0001 issued September 28, 2012.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;There are no current proceedings.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '%0.'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'decimal'; -aw-list-number-values: '9'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 9.66pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;9.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="width: 9.66pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Legal Matters&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;HPGT is involved in various legal actions arising in the ordinary course of business.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;While it is not feasible to predict the ultimate outcome of these actions, management believes that the resolution of these actions will not have a material effect, either individually or in the aggregate, on HPGT's financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Environmental Matters&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;HPGT is not aware of any events of non-compliance with respect to environmental matters, the effects of which could have a material effect on its financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '%0.'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'decimal'; -aw-list-number-values: '10'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 4.1pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;10.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="width: 4.1pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Related-Party Transactions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Transportation Services&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;During 2025 and 2024, no transportation revenues were earned from related parties.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;All transportation revenues earned were at rates pursuant to the existing tariffs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Operating and Administrative Expenses&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Since HPGT has no employees, operating, maintenance, and general and administrative services are provided under service agreements with the operator.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Substantially all labor costs, audit, insurance, legal fees, intercompany gas purchases and intercompany gas imbalances during 2025 and 2024 were $4,741,969 and $4,692,377, respectively.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On December 31, 2025 and 2024, HPGT had affiliate payables of $0.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;These charges are settled and classified as Operations Expenses or Administrative/General Expenses on the Statement of Income.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '%0.'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'decimal'; -aw-list-number-values: '11'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 4.1pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;11.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="width: 4.1pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We evaluated our December 31, 2025 financial statements for subsequent events through April 8, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
